---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const brand = (await getCollection('brand'))[0].data;
---

<BaseLayout {brand} title="Category Signal — AURA Direction 06" description="Concept direction: a decisive contrarian manifesto for category-creating experts." transparentHeader={false} bodyClass="direction direction--signal">
  <section class="cs-hero">
    <div class="cs-nav"><span>AURA / CATEGORY SIGNAL</span><span>CONCEPT 06</span><span>THE NEXT MODEL IS ALREADY HERE</span></div>
    <div class="cs-hero__copy"><p class="cs-tag">The old playbook is expensive</p><h1>MORE<br /><s>VISIBILITY.</s><br /><em>LESS</em><br />MISREADING.</h1><p>Most experts do not have a reach problem. They have an interpretation problem. The market sees activity, not the operating system behind it.</p><a href="#replace">See what to replace <b>↓</b></a></div>
    <div class="cs-hero__image"><img src="/images/stage-tight.webp" alt="Conceptual strategist speaking with decisive energy" width="1600" height="1000" /><div class="cs-hero__image-note">YOUR<br />DIFFERENCE<br />SHOULD<br />SURVIVE<br />THE<br />SCROLL.</div></div>
    <div class="cs-side">001 / CONTRARIAN<br />THESIS / NOT A<br />TAGLINE</div>
  </section>

  <section id="replace" class="cs-replace"><header><p class="cs-tag">The replacement rail</p><h2>STOP<br />DOING<br /><em>THIS.</em></h2></header><div class="cs-replace__rows"><article><div><span>Old model / 01</span><h3>More posts</h3></div><b>×</b><div><span>Better model / 01</span><h3>One repeatable idea</h3><p>A named point of view people can use when describing the work to someone else.</p></div></article><article><div><span>Old model / 02</span><h3>More credentials</h3></div><b>×</b><div><span>Better model / 02</span><h3>One clear receipt</h3><p>Permissioned evidence that makes the actual value of the work easy to believe.</p></div></article><article><div><span>Old model / 03</span><h3>More services</h3></div><b>×</b><div><span>Better model / 03</span><h3>One useful system</h3><p>A recognizable operating method that turns expertise into a decision someone can buy.</p></div></article></div></section>

  <section class="cs-blueprint"><div class="cs-blueprint__head"><p class="cs-tag">The named system</p><h2>THE<br />SIGNAL<br /><em>STACK.</em></h2><p>A visual argument needs a structure. The category signal stack makes a complex body of work readable in the order the buyer needs to believe it.</p></div><div class="cs-stack"><article><span>01</span><h3>The tension</h3><p>What the room already feels but cannot name.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>The break</h3><p>Which familiar assumption is now costing more than it returns.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>The model</h3><p>The named sequence that resolves the tension in a different way.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>The receipt</h3><p>The actual evidence that makes a better decision plausible.</p></article></div></section>

  <section class="cs-case"><div class="cs-case__eyebrow"><span>FIELD NOTE / 01</span><span>CONCEPTUAL STRUCTURE — USE ONLY WITH APPROVED EVIDENCE</span></div><div class="cs-case__title"><h2>THE CASE IS<br />NOT A<br /><em>TESTIMONIAL.</em></h2><p>It is a small argument: the initial condition, the decision, the intervention, the observed change. Evidence should make the view more useful—not just flatter the expert.</p></div><figure><img src="/images/workshop.webp" alt="Conceptual workshop showing active transformation work" width="1920" height="1280" /><figcaption><span>01 / CONTEXT</span><span>What was at risk?</span><span>02 / INTERVENTION</span><span>What changed?</span><span>03 / RECEIPT</span><span>What can be shown?</span></figcaption></figure><a href="/case-studies/">Open the case-study system ↗</a></section>

  <section class="cs-manifesto"><div class="cs-manifesto__label">READ THIS<br />BEFORE YOU<br />MAKE ANOTHER<br />LANDING PAGE</div><blockquote>“A brand is not the<br />feeling after someone<br />sees the work. It is the<br /><em>decision</em> they can make<br />because they finally<br />understand it.”</blockquote><p>— The Category Signal, concept note 01</p></section>

  <section class="cs-cta"><p class="cs-tag">Run the diagnostic</p><h2>IS THE<br />OLD MODEL<br />COSTING<br />YOU THE<br /><em>RIGHT ROOM?</em></h2><a href="/contact/">Find the signal gap ↗</a></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(.direction--signal) { --cs-black:#121313; --cs-paper:#f3f2ea; --cs-red:#ff4e2a; --cs-lime:#d6ff45; --cs-gray:#9ea09d; background:var(--cs-black); color:var(--cs-paper); } :global(.direction--signal .announcement-bar) { display:none; } :global(.direction--signal .site-header) { background:var(--cs-black); color:var(--cs-paper); border-bottom:1px solid #4c4e4d; } :global(.direction--signal .site-header a) { color:var(--cs-paper); } :global(.direction--signal .site-footer) { background:var(--cs-black); border-top:1px solid #4c4e4d; }
  .cs-hero { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; min-height:calc(100svh - 4.5rem); overflow:hidden; } .cs-nav { position:absolute; z-index:4; top:0; left:0; right:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:1rem; padding:.85rem clamp(1rem,3vw,3rem); border-bottom:1px solid #4c4e4d; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.56rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-nav span:nth-child(2) { text-align:center; color:var(--cs-lime); } .cs-nav span:last-child { text-align:right; color:#a2a5a2; } .cs-hero__copy { position:relative; z-index:2; display:grid; align-content:end; padding:clamp(8rem,15vh,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,6vw,7rem) clamp(4rem,9vw,8rem); } .cs-tag { margin:0; color:var(--cs-lime); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.62rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.15em; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-hero h1,.cs-replace h2,.cs-blueprint h2,.cs-case h2,.cs-cta h2 { margin:1.2rem 0 0; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:clamp(4rem,9.5vw,11rem); font-weight:800; line-height:.74; letter-spacing:-.1em; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-hero h1 s { color:#696b69; text-decoration-color:var(--cs-red); text-decoration-thickness:.18em; } .cs-hero h1 em,.cs-replace h2 em,.cs-blueprint h2 em,.cs-case h2 em,.cs-manifesto em,.cs-cta h2 em { color:var(--cs-red); font-family:var(--font-serif); font-weight:400; letter-spacing:-.12em; } .cs-hero__copy > p:not(.cs-tag) { max-width:30rem; margin:2rem 0 0; color:#d0d2ce; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.7; } .cs-hero__copy a,.cs-case > a,.cs-cta a { display:inline-block; margin-top:2rem; padding:.9rem 1rem; background:var(--cs-lime); color:var(--cs-black); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.63rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-hero__copy a:hover,.cs-case > a:hover,.cs-cta a:hover { background:var(--cs-red); color:var(--cs-paper); } .cs-hero__image { position:relative; background:var(--cs-red); overflow:hidden; } .cs-hero__image img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.2); mix-blend-mode:multiply; } .cs-hero__image::after { position:absolute; inset:0; content:''; background:linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(255,78,42,.45),transparent 65%); } .cs-hero__image-note { position:absolute; z-index:1; top:50%; right:clamp(1rem,3vw,3rem); color:var(--cs-lime); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,2rem); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.05em; line-height:.85; text-align:right; } .cs-side { position:absolute; z-index:4; bottom:1.5rem; right:1.25rem; color:var(--cs-paper); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.52rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; line-height:1.5; text-align:right; }
  .cs-replace { padding:clamp(5rem,11vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,6vw,7rem); background:var(--cs-paper); color:var(--cs-black); } .cs-replace .cs-tag { color:#687e07; } .cs-replace h2 { font-size:clamp(3.3rem,7vw,8rem); } .cs-replace h2 em { color:var(--cs-red); } .cs-replace__rows { margin-top:clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem); border-top:2px solid var(--cs-black); } .cs-replace__rows article { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 4rem 1fr; gap:1rem; align-items:center; padding:1.5rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid #858783; } .cs-replace__rows span { color:#6c6d69; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.56rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-replace__rows h3 { margin:.8rem 0 0; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,3rem); line-height:.9; letter-spacing:-.06em; } .cs-replace__rows article > b { display:grid; place-items:center; width:2rem; height:2rem; border:1px solid var(--cs-black); border-radius:50%; color:var(--cs-red); font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:1.7rem; font-weight:400; } .cs-replace__rows p { max-width:23rem; margin:.7rem 0 0; color:#555752; line-height:1.55; }
  .cs-blueprint { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr; gap:clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem); padding:clamp(5rem,11vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,6vw,7rem); background:var(--cs-red); color:var(--cs-black); } .cs-blueprint .cs-tag { color:var(--cs-black); } .cs-blueprint h2 { font-size:clamp(3.5rem,6.5vw,7.3rem); } .cs-blueprint h2 em { color:var(--cs-paper); } .cs-blueprint__head > p:not(.cs-tag) { max-width:29rem; margin:2rem 0 0; line-height:1.7; } .cs-stack { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1px; background:var(--cs-black); border:1px solid var(--cs-black); } .cs-stack article { display:grid; min-height:16rem; align-content:start; padding:1.5rem; background:var(--cs-red); } .cs-stack article span { color:var(--cs-lime); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.66rem; font-weight:800; } .cs-stack article h3 { margin:3.3rem 0 0; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.7rem; line-height:.9; letter-spacing:-.05em; } .cs-stack article p { margin:.7rem 0 0; max-width:13rem; line-height:1.55; }
  .cs-case { padding:clamp(5rem,11vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,6vw,7rem); } .cs-case__eyebrow { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; color:#9ea09d; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.56rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; line-height:1.4; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-case__title { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr; gap:2rem; align-items:end; margin-top:2rem; } .cs-case h2 { font-size:clamp(3.2rem,7vw,8.6rem); } .cs-case__title p { max-width:23rem; color:#c2c4c0; line-height:1.7; } .cs-case figure { position:relative; min-height:28rem; margin:clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem) 0 0; background:var(--cs-lime); overflow:hidden; } .cs-case figure img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.25); mix-blend-mode:multiply; } .cs-case figcaption { position:absolute; left:1.2rem; right:1.2rem; bottom:1.2rem; display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr; gap:.8rem; color:var(--cs-paper); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.55rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.11em; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-case figcaption span:nth-child(odd) { color:var(--cs-lime); } .cs-case > a { margin-top:1.5rem; }
  .cs-manifesto { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.4fr 1.6fr; gap:3rem; padding:clamp(5rem,11vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,12vw,12rem); background:var(--cs-lime); color:var(--cs-black); } .cs-manifesto__label,.cs-manifesto > p { font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.58rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; line-height:1.5; text-transform:uppercase; } .cs-manifesto blockquote { grid-column:2; max-width:16ch; margin:0; font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5.8rem); line-height:.92; letter-spacing:-.07em; } .cs-manifesto em { color:var(--cs-red); } .cs-manifesto > p { grid-column:2; margin:0; }
  .cs-cta { padding:clamp(5rem,11vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,6vw,7rem); background:var(--cs-black); color:var(--cs-paper); } .cs-cta h2 { max-width:8ch; font-size:clamp(3rem,7.5vw,8.5rem); } .cs-cta h2 em { color:var(--cs-lime); } .cs-cta a { margin-top:2.5rem; }
  @media (max-width:760px) { .cs-nav { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } .cs-nav span:last-child { display:none; } .cs-hero,.cs-blueprint,.cs-case__title,.cs-manifesto { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .cs-hero__image { min-height:23rem; } .cs-hero__copy { padding-bottom:3rem; } .cs-side { display:none; } .cs-replace__rows article { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:.8rem; } .cs-replace__rows article > b { transform:rotate(45deg); } .cs-stack { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .cs-case__eyebrow { display:grid; } .cs-case figcaption { grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; } .cs-case figcaption span:nth-child(3),.cs-case figcaption span:nth-child(5) { margin-top:.5rem; } .cs-manifesto blockquote,.cs-manifesto > p { grid-column:auto; } }
</style>
